    "title": "High School Basketball Scores and Weather Report",
    "text": "• Betty Fairfax defeated Metro Tech with a score of 92-30.\n• Peoria Centennial defeated Eastmark with a score of 55-51.\n• Phoenix Alhambra defeated Sierra Linda with a score of 62-59.\n• Phoenix Pinnacle defeated Tucson IRHS with a score of 67-34.\n• Tucson Catalina Foothills defeated Rio Rico with a score of 81-48.\n• Tucson Flowing Wells defeated Tanque Verde with a score of 72-64.\n• Tucson Sunnyside defeated Tucson Canyon del Oro with a score of 79-68.\n• High school basketball scores were provided by Scorestream.com.\n• The weather forecast includes some clouds with a low of 56F and winds from the N at 5 to 10 mph.\n• The forecast for the day includes mostly cloudy skies early, becoming partly cloudy later, with a high of 76F and winds from the N at 10 to 15 mph.",
